raven decreed but that may be coming to an end the main industry in this part of canada is timber

00:53:58.400 --> 00:53:59.980
and the island of the

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:05.950
ghost bear has been marked off into logging concessions at its northern tip

00:54:05.970 --> 00:54:23.180
the cutting has already begun eventually timber companies plan to move

00:54:23.180 --> 00:54:29.310
into the interior of the island where our young male lives where ghost bears have

